+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/generate-fy — make the twelve monthly periods of a fiscal year. Body
+# {"year":"2026"}: fiscal year FY2026 starts on the first of the sheet's fiscal start month in 2026; each of
+# its months is made as the period generator makes it (a month whose name is taken or whose days overlap a
+# period is left out). A year that is not yyyy is refused with 400 and nothing is stored. Responds {"made":n}.
